                                "sense_id": "6d376ef9-807e-3b32-9b6e-104cc5349a58",
                                "text": "The experiment may be varied in this way: Placing in front of the polarizer a plate of unannealed glass, you have a series of beautifully coloured rings, intersected by a black cross."
